# VS Code Extension Recommendations for AI Lip-Sync Generator

## Recommended Extensions

### Essential
- **Python** (ms-python.python) - Python IntelliSense, linting, debugging
- **Pylance** (ms-python.vscode-pylance) - Fast Python language support

### Helpful
- **Better Comments** (aaron-bond.better-comments) - Color-coded comments
- **Path Intellisense** (christian-kohler.path-intellisense) - File path autocomplete
- **Material Icon Theme** (PKief.material-icon-theme) - Better file icons

### Optional
- **Python Indent** (KevinRose.vsc-python-indent) - Better Python indentation
- **autoDocstring** (njpwerner.autodocstring) - Generate docstrings
- **Error Lens** (usernamehw.errorlens) - Inline error highlighting
